! name: Patient Reviews Discovery
! description: Boost known patient review platforms and block low quality / fake review directories
! public: true
! author: Priya Patel

boost:site:realself.com
boost:site:yelp.com
boost:site:healthgrades.com
boost:site:zocdoc.com
boost:site:google.com

-block:trustpilotreviews.com
-block:topreviewsites.com
-block:bestreviewsite.com
-block:reviewscorecard.com
-block:scamreview.com

-block:yellowpages.com
-block:manta.com
-block:hotfrog.com
-block:bizapedia.com
-block:chamberofcommerce.com

-block:reddit.com
-block:quora.com
-block:tiktok.com
-block:facebook.com
